{"id":"P064-1","subject":"P","unit":"P064","unitTitle":"2024 하반기 · 24.11.16 한전 KPS (G3) (휴노)","set":1,"questions":[{"id":"P064-S1-Q01","number":1,"question":"24.11.16 한전 KPS (G3) (휴노) · 객관식 1번","searchText":" 01\n\n변압기의 온도상승시험 방법에 해당하는 것은?\n\n\n① 실부하법, 무부하시험\n\n② 반환부하법, 무부하시험\n\n③ 반환부하법, 등가부하법\n\n④ 무부하시험, 단락시험\n\n⑤ 단락시험, 실부하법","source":{"collection":"2024h2","collectionLabel":"2024 하반기","examLabel":"24.11.16 한전 KPS (G3) (휴노)","originalId":"2024h2-e23-m01","number":1},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e23-m01-q.webp","width":678,"height":643},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e23-m01-e1.webp","width":678,"height":1282}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"5번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P064-S1-Q02","number":2,"question":"24.11.16 한전 KPS (G3) (휴노) · 객관식 2번","searchText":" 02\n\n3상 유도 전동기의 동기속도가 500rpm이고, 회전자의\n회전속도가 475rpm일 때, 2차 효율은 몇 인가?\n\n\n① 75          ② 80\n\n③ 85          ④ 90\n\n⑤ 95","source":{"collection":"2024h2","collectionLabel":"2024 하반기","examLabel":"24.11.16 한전 KPS (G3) (휴노)","originalId":"2024h2-e23-m02","number":2},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e23-m02-q.webp","width":678,"height":603},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e23-m02-e1.webp","width":696,"height":608}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"5번","correct":true,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P064-S1-Q03","number":3,"question":"24.11.16 한전 KPS (G3) (휴노) · 객관식 3번","searchText":" 03\n\n단중 중권 4극 직류 전동기의 전 도체수가 200, 극당\n\n자속이 0.2이다. 전동기의 토크가 20N⦁m인 경우의\n부하전류는 몇 A 인가?\n\n\n                       \n①           ② \n\n③            ④ \n\n⑤ ","source":{"collection":"2024h2","collectionLabel":"2024 하반기","examLabel":"24.11.16 한전 KPS (G3) (휴노)","originalId":"2024h2-e23-m03","number":3},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e23-m03-q.webp","width":678,"height":494},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e23-m03-e1.webp","width":696,"height":1227},{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e23-m03-e2.webp","width":678,"height":1174}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"5번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P064-S1-Q04","number":4,"question":"24.11.16 한전 KPS (G3) (휴노) · 객관식 4번","searchText":" 04\n\n5000/500V 단상 변압기의 퍼센트 임피던스가 1.2,\n1차측 환산 임피던스가 Ω일 때, 변압기의 용량은\n\n몇 kVA인가?\n\n\n① 60          ② 90\n\n③ 120         ④ 150\n\n⑤ 180","source":{"collection":"2024h2","collectionLabel":"2024 하반기","examLabel":"24.11.16 한전 KPS (G3) (휴노)","originalId":"2024h2-e23-m04","number":4},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e23-m04-q.webp","width":696,"height":563},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e23-m04-e1.webp","width":678,"height":710}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"5번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P064-S1-Q05","number":5,"question":"24.11.16 한전 KPS (G3) (휴노) · 객관식 5번","searchText":" 05\n\n다음 중 3상을 2상으로 변환할 수 있는 결선법은?\n\n\n① 대각 결선, 포크 결선\n\n② 환상 결선, 우드브리지 결선\n\n③ 우드브리지 결선, 포크결선\n\n④ 메이어 결선, scott 결선\n\n⑤ 포크 결선, 환상 결선","source":{"collection":"2024h2","collectionLabel":"2024 하반기","examLabel":"24.11.16 한전 KPS (G3) (휴노)","originalId":"2024h2-e23-m05","number":5},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e23-m05-q.webp","width":696,"height":563},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e23-m05-e1.webp","width":696,"height":783}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"5번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P064-S1-Q06","number":6,"question":"24.11.16 한전 KPS (G3) (휴노) · 객관식 6번","searchText":" 06\n\n직류 전동기의 제동법에 대한 설명으로 옳지 않은 것은?\n\n\n① 발전제동은 전동기를 발전기로 작동시켜 발생된 전\n\n  력을 단자에 접속된 저항에서 열로 소비시키면서 제동\n\n  하는 방법이다.\n\n② 직권 전동기와 복권전동기를 발전제동으로 제동하기\n\n  위해서는 계자의 접속을 반대로 해야한다.\n\n③ 회생제동은 전동기의 제동시 발생된 전력은 반환하여\n\n  제동 전원으로 사용된다.\n\n④ 플러깅 제동은 전기자권선, 계자권선 중 하나의 극성을\n\n  반대로하여 급제동시 사용한다.\n\n⑤ 타여자 전동기의 플러깅 제동은 전원전압의 극성을\n\n  반대로 하여 사용할 수 있다.","source":{"collection":"2024h2","collectionLabel":"2024 하반기","examLabel":"24.11.16 한전 KPS (G3) (휴노)","originalId":"2024h2-e23-m06","number":6},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e23-m06-q.webp","width":696,"height":710},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e23-m06-e1.webp","width":696,"height":1099}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"5번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P064-S1-Q07","number":7,"question":"24.11.16 한전 KPS (G3) (휴노) · 객관식 7번","searchText":" 07\n\n22.5kW, 50V의 단중 중권 직류 분권 발전기의 전기\n\n자 슬롯수가 200, 슬롯 당 도체수가 6, 극당 자속수가\n\n0.01, 회전속도가 260rpm, 부하전류가 200A일\n\n때, 전기자 저항은 몇 Ω인가?\n\n\n① 0.01         ② 0.05\n\n③ 0.1          ④ 0.5\n\n⑤ 1","source":{"collection":"2024h2","collectionLabel":"2024 하반기","examLabel":"24.11.16 한전 KPS (G3) (휴노)","originalId":"2024h2-e23-m07","number":7},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e23-m07-q.webp","width":678,"height":643},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e23-m07-e1.webp","width":678,"height":1176}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"5번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P064-S1-Q08","number":8,"question":"24.11.16 한전 KPS (G3) (휴노) · 객관식 8번","searchText":" 08\n\n200kW, 역률이 80인 부하에 단상 변압기 2대를\n\nV결선하여 전력을 공급할 때, 단상 변압기의 용량은 몇\n\nkVA 인가?\n\n\n                        \n①            ②                           \n\n                        \n③            ④                           \n\n    \n⑤    ","source":{"collection":"2024h2","collectionLabel":"2024 하반기","examLabel":"24.11.16 한전 KPS (G3) (휴노)","originalId":"2024h2-e23-m08","number":8},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e23-m08-q.webp","width":678,"height":708},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e23-m08-e1.webp","width":678,"height":706}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"5번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P064-S1-Q09","number":9,"question":"24.11.16 한전 KPS (G3) (휴노) · 객관식 9번","searchText":" 09\n\n3상 300kVA 변압기에서 2차측 선간전압이 100V일\n\n때, 선전류는 몇 A 인가?\n\n①          ② \n③          ④ \n\n⑤ ","source":{"collection":"2024h2","collectionLabel":"2024 하반기","examLabel":"24.11.16 한전 KPS (G3) (휴노)","originalId":"2024h2-e23-m09","number":9},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e23-m09-q.webp","width":678,"height":532},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e23-m09-e1.webp","width":696,"height":1061}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"5번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P064-S1-Q10","number":10,"question":"24.11.16 한전 KPS (G3) (휴노) · 객관식 10번","searchText":" 10\n\n2차측 무부하 단자전압이 1050V인 변압기의 전압변동\n\n률이 5일 때, 단자전압은 몇 V인가?\n\n\n① 850         ② 900\n\n③ 950         ④ 1000\n\n⑤ 1020","source":{"collection":"2024h2","collectionLabel":"2024 하반기","examLabel":"24.11.16 한전 KPS (G3) (휴노)","originalId":"2024h2-e23-m10","number":10},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e23-m10-q.webp","width":696,"height":603},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e23-m10-e1.webp","width":696,"height":821}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"5번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P064-S1-Q11","number":11,"question":"24.11.16 한전 KPS (G3) (휴노) · 객관식 11번","searchText":" 11\n\n1차 전압이 2000V, 2차 전압이 2200V인 단권변압기의\n\n부하용량이 50kVA일 때, 자기용량은 약 몇 kVA인가?\n\n\n① 2           ② 2.5\n\n③ 3           ④ 4\n\n⑤ 4.5","source":{"collection":"2024h2","collectionLabel":"2024 하반기","examLabel":"24.11.16 한전 KPS (G3) (휴노)","originalId":"2024h2-e23-m11","number":11},"questionI